# --- Dolt ---
# The demo database IS shipped (it is the demo content: Street Feast replay),
# but only its durable data files. Everything Dolt rewrites at runtime is
# ignored: server config (contains a machine-specific absolute data_dir —
# run.py rewrites it on start), credentials, locks, journals, stats.
.dolt-data/config.yaml
.dolt-data/.dolt/
.dolt-data/.doltcfg/
.dolt-data/**/LOCK
.dolt-data/**/journal.idx
.dolt-data/**/repo_state.json
.dolt-data/malleable/.dolt/stats/
.dolt-data/malleable/.dolt/temptf/
